				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				5214,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with Sky and Output changes\n\nRoutine submodule synchronization bringing in latest changes from the application stack:\n\n1. Sky (c32ec836):\n   - Fix URI object construction for workbench search result deduplication\n   - Previous manual resource object construction (`{ $mid: 1, path, scheme }`) failed when workbench attempted result deduplication via `uri.with({...})` because POJOs lack methods, causing \"uri.with is not a function\" errors\n   - Add CelUriCtor and CelUri interfaces to type VS Code's URI class\n   - Create MakeFileUri that uses actual Ctor.file() method when __CEL_SERVICES__.URI is available\n   - Update both MatchFromHit (text search results) and file search result mapping to use MakeFileUri\n   - Include last-resort POJO fallback for edge cases\n\n2. Output (c7ea59e9):\n   - Expose URI class from vscode-uri to workbench accessor exports, providing full prototype chain (`.with()`, `.fsPath`, `.toString()`) needed by SkyBridge's search provider\n\nImpact: Search results now properly deduplicate in the workbench, eliminating duplicate file entries in quick open and search views.",
			"SHA": "f64c07f9d67a04d38d6ec2324b1248b4df99299f"
		},
