			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with Sky, Worker, Wind, Cocoon, and Output changes\n\nRoutine submodule synchronization bringing in latest changes across the application stack:\n1. Sky (70de1fdb):\n   - Extract worker script imports into dedicated WorkerBundleImports.astro component to fix Astro compiler hoisting issue in JSX conditionals\n   - Add comprehensive RenderDevLog diagnostics for search operations\n   - Replace single-shot workbench-ready retry with three parallel rescue paths for search provider registration\n   - Add SearchRegistered flag to prevent duplicate registration attempts\n2. Worker (e8bdbb87):\n   - Expand minified ESBuild config files with source maps\n   - Reverse minification to aid debugging ESBuild pipeline issues while preserving configuration logic\n3. Cocoon (ca5878fa), Output (6b389ee0), Wind (56a0603f):\n   - Submodule sync to latest changes\n\nImpact: Bundle-mode build failures resolved. Search provider registration now handles edge cases with parallel fallback paths. ESBuild pipeline debugging improved with source maps in worker configs.",
