			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with Output, Sky, and Cocoon changes\n\nRoutine submodule synchronization bringing in latest changes across the application stack:\n\n1. Output (36ce8f4a):\n   - Expand CopyVSRootFiles candidate resolution to check both `<root>/<file>` and `<root>/vs/<file>` paths for NLS and other VS Code outputs at different TSC pass locations\n   - Add NODE_ENV-aware directory ordering: production prioritizes `out-build/` (release TSC flat layout) before `out/` (debug TSC source layout), development does the reverse\n   - Preserve tier 4 inline stub fallback for missing NLS files\n\n2. Sky (87d32133):\n   - Restore Bundle mode distinction for worker script loading in Electron.astro\n   - Bundle=true profiles use npm-package imports inside single <script> block for Vite bundling\n   - Bundle=false profiles continue using separate <script> tags for static assets\n   - Maintain CSS Load → Policy → Register ordering requirement\n\n3. Cocoon (8715468b):\n   - Submodule sync to latest extension host changes\n\nImpact: Output now correctly copies NLS files from both root and vs/ directories with proper NODE_ENV ordering. Sky restores compatibility with both bundled and non-bundled build profiles. Extension host updated to latest.",
